---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/sections/PageHero.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';

const updated = '2 October 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  crumbs={[{ name: 'Privacy', path: '/privacy/' }]}
  title="Privacy | Virat Digital"
  description="What Virat Digital collects when you get in touch, why, how long it's kept, and how to see, correct or delete it."
>
  <PageHero title="Privacy" lead="What I collect when you get in touch, why, and what you can ask me to do with it." />

  <section class="section-sm">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="prose">
        <p><em>Last updated {updated}.</em></p>

        <h2>Who's responsible</h2>
        <p>
          Virat Digital is an independent studio run by one person. I'm responsible for the information
          described here. You can reach me at <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>What I collect</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>The contact form:</strong> your name, your email address and/or WhatsApp number, the service you're interested in, your project details and, if you choose, a timeline.</li>
          <li><strong>WhatsApp, email and social messages:</strong> whatever you choose to send me there.</li>
          <li><strong>Your theme choice:</strong> if you switch between light and dark, that choice is saved in your own browser. It never reaches me.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>This site doesn't use advertising or tracking cookies.</p>

        <h2>Why I use it</h2>
        <p>
          Only to reply to you, prepare a quote, and, if we work together, run the project and keep the
          records the law requires. I don't sell or share your details for marketing, and I won't add you
          to a mailing list.
        </p>

        <h2>Where it's stored</h2>
        <p>
          Form messages are delivered through the site's hosting provider and arrive in my email inbox.
          WhatsApp messages stay in WhatsApp. These providers process the data on my behalf.
        </p>

        <h2>How long it's kept</h2>
        <p>
          Enquiries are kept only as long as they're needed to reply and follow up. If you become a client,
          project details are kept for the project and for as long as tax and accounting rules require.
        </p>

        <h2>Your rights</h2>
        <p>
          You can ask to see the information I hold about you, have it corrected, or have it deleted, and
          you can withdraw your consent at any time. Email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>
          and I'll reply within 30 days. This includes any complaint about how your data has been handled.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
